  "text": "The query lists superhero names and heights for heroes published by Marvel Comics, ranked in descending order of height using RANK() (ties get the same rank).",
  "sql": "SELECT s.superhero_name, s.height_cm,\n       RANK() OVER (ORDER BY s.height_cm DESC) AS height_rank\nFROM superhero s\nJOIN publisher p ON s.publisher_id = p.id\nWHERE p.publisher_name = 'Marvel Comics'\nORDER BY s.height_cm DESC;",
